# RULE-ID PATH-GLOB REASON   (owner-reviewed; every allowlisted finding is still printed)
#
# Test inputs for credential handling. Each is an invented value the test feeds to code that must
# reject, hide or never return it; none names a real credential.
credentials-in-url internal/api/http_test.go test input: an integration URL carrying credentials must be rejected
secret-assignment internal/feread/client_test.go test fixture: invented bearer value for a fake upstream
#
# History only: the WebAuthn operation-proof test vector that lived in the removed assurance
# package (a follow-up restores that package from git history). It is canned protocol data, not a key.
generic-api-key internal/assurance/testdata/* test vector from the removed assurance package, not a credential
#
# An HTML autocomplete attribute value ("new-password"), not a credential.
secret-assignment frontend/src/pages/entry.tsx HTML autocomplete attribute value "new-password", not a credential
#
# Fleet inventory alias required by deploy.yaml (fleet-deploy/v1) to name the target host; not an address.
agent-box-host deploy.yaml fleet inventory alias required by fleet-deploy/v1, not an address
